      "id": "ghrp-6",
      "name": "GHRP-6",
      "aliases": [],
      "kind": "product",
      "identityStatus": "needs_confirmation",
      "categoryID": 4,
      "benefits": "Demonstrated biological effect: stimulates growth hormone secretion in small human endocrine studies. This supports its role as a GH secretagogue, rather than proving a wellness benefit. A clinical investigation also found combined GHRH/GHRP-6 stimulation useful for distinguishing adults with severe GH deficiency from healthy controls. That diagnostic result concerns the combination test; it does not establish standalone GHRP-6 treatment benefits for muscle, recovery, fat loss, or longevity."
    }
  ],
